#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_gap.php:14
msgid ""
"The billing shown is the last one before the break. Either it ends too "
"early, or the one after it starts too late."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazená fakturace je poslední před mezerou. Buď končí příliš brzy, nebo ta "
"následující začíná příliš pozdě."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_gap.php:31
msgid "Billing Resumes"
msgstr "Fakturace pokračuje"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_gap.php:32
msgid "Days Not Billed"
msgstr "Dnů bez fakturace"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_service_type_mismatch.php:13
msgid ""
"Every report that counts what is sold by kind of service counts these under "
"the wrong heading."
msgstr ""
"Každý přehled, který počítá prodej podle druhu služby, tyhle počítá pod "
"špatnou položkou."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_service_type_mismatch.php:26
msgid "The Service Is For"
msgstr "Typ podle služby"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/billing_service_type_mismatch.php:27
msgid "The Contract Is For"
msgstr "Typ podle smlouvy"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/contract_version_gap.php:13
msgid ""
"Not always a fault: a contract can lapse and be signed again. The other "
"reading is a mistyped date."
msgstr ""
"Ne vždy chyba: smlouva mohla vypršet a být znovu podepsaná. Druhé čtení je "
"překlep v datu."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/contract_version_gap.php:27
msgid "Next One In Force From"
msgstr "Další platná od"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/contract_version_gap.php:28
msgid "Days Without a Version"
msgstr "Dnů bez verze"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_billing_period.php:13
msgid "A billing that ends before it begins invoices nothing at all."
msgstr "Fakturace, která končí dřív, než začíná, nenafakturuje vůbec nic."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_borrowed_period.php:13
msgid ""
"Equipment cannot come back before it went out. Until the day is right it is "
"counted somewhere it is not."
msgstr ""
"Zařízení se nemůže vrátit dřív, než bylo vydané. Dokud datum nesedí, je "
"vedené jinde, než ve skutečnosti je."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_contract_dates.php:14
msgid "A service cannot be taken away or stopped before it was ever installed."
msgstr "Službu nelze deinstalovat ani ukončit dřív, než byla nainstalovaná."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/impossible_contract_version_period.php:13
msgid ""
"A version cannot end before it begins, and its minimum term cannot be over "
"before the version exists."
msgstr ""
"Verze nemůže skončit dřív, než začne, a její závazek nemůže vypršet dřív, "
"než verze vznikne."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/inactive_with_billing.php:13
msgid ""
"What puts a contract here is the billing running on past the day the "
"contract itself stopped."
msgstr ""
"Na seznam se smlouva dostane tím, že fakturace běží dál i po dni, kdy "
"smlouva sama skončila."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/inactive_with_billing.php:27
msgid "Billed Until"
msgstr "Fakturováno do"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/inactive_with_billing.php:51
#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:50
#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_contract_versions.php:44
msgid "open"
msgstr "otevřená"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/non_standard_service.php:13
msgid ""
"Not a fault on its own. Where the same thing is written by hand again and "
"again, it is a service the price list is still missing."
msgstr ""
"Samo o sobě to není chyba. Když se totéž píše ručně znovu a znovu, chybí ta "
"služba v ceníku."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:13
msgid ""
"The billing shown is the earlier of the two. Usually it was left open when "
"the next one was written - and two tariffs at once are an overlap however "
"differently they are named."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazená fakturace je ta dřívější z dvojice. Obvykle jí při psaní té další "
"zůstal otevřený konec — a dva tarify naráz jsou překryv, i když se jmenují "
"jinak."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:31
msgid "Billed Twice From"
msgstr "Dvojí fakturace od"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_billings.php:32
msgid "Overlaps With"
msgstr "Překrývá se s"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_contract_versions.php:13
msgid ""
"The version shown is the earlier of the two. While both are in force nothing "
"can say which terms apply."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazená verze je ta dřívější z dvojice. Dokud platí obě, nelze říct, které "
"podmínky platí."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/overlapping_contract_versions.php:27
msgid "Second One In Force From"
msgstr "Druhá platná od"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unapplied_proposal.php:13
msgid ""
"The customer has agreed to something and the records still say the old "
"thing, so the service runs and is invoiced on the old terms until somebody "
"applies the changes."
msgstr ""
"Zákazník s něčím souhlasil a záznamy stále říkají to staré, takže služba "
"běží a fakturuje se za starých podmínek, dokud někdo neaplikuje změny."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unfiled_signature.php:13
msgid ""
"The signature is recorded and the signed documents were never filed. Nothing "
"is held up by it, but there is nothing to show for what was agreed either."
msgstr ""
"Podpis je zapsaný, ale podepsané dokumenty k němu chybí. Nic se tím "
"nezdržuje, jen není čím doložit, co bylo dohodnuto."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsent_proposal.php:13
msgid ""
"The proposal was created and never sent. The day it takes effect comes "
"whether or not the customer has seen it."
msgstr ""
"Návrh je vytvořený a nikdy nebyl odeslán. Den účinnosti nastane, ať už ho "
"zákazník viděl, nebo ne."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsettled_obligation.php:13
msgid ""
"Either something is owed and nobody has asked for it, or it was waived and "
"nobody has ticked \"obligations settled\"."
msgstr ""
"Buď se něco dluží a nikdo o to neřekl, nebo se to odpustilo a nikdo "
"nezaškrtl „Závazky vypořádány“."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:17
msgid ""
"Either nothing says when it was concluded, or what says so is from long "
"before it took effect."
msgstr ""
"Buď nic neříká, kdy byla uzavřená, nebo je to z doby dlouho před začátkem "
"její platnosti."

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:36
msgid "Deadline"
msgstr "Lhůta"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:74
msgid "Due to be cut off"
msgstr "K odpojení"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:76
msgid "Due a reminder"
msgstr "K upomínce"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:78
msgid "In time until {0}"
msgstr "V termínu do {0}"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_contract.php:53
msgctxt "sending date"
msgid "Not recorded"
msgstr "Nezaznamenáno"

#: templates/element/ContractChecks/unsigned_proposal.php:13
msgid ""
"The proposal was sent and has not come back signed. No changes are applied "
"to the records until it does."
msgstr ""
"Návrh byl odeslán a nevrátil se podepsaný. Dokud se nevrátí, žádné změny se "
"do záznamů neaplikují."

#: templates/element/ContractProposalslying_changes.php:21
msgid "Worth knowing first"
msgstr "Co je dobré vědět"

#: templates/element/ContractProposalslying_changes.php:30
msgid ""
"This contract proposal changes nothing. It is the record of what was sent, "
"and applying it only marks it as dealt with."
msgstr ""
"Tento návrh smlouvy nic nemění. Je záznamem toho, co bylo odesláno, a "
"aplikováním se jen označí za vyřízený."

#: templates/element/ContractProposalslying_changes.php:35
#: templates/element/ContractProposals/planned_changes.php:28
msgid "As it is now"
msgstr "Jak je to teď"

#: templates/element/ContractProposalslying_changes.php:39
#: templates/element/ContractProposals/planned_changes.php:30
msgid "As it would be"
msgstr "Jak by to bylo"

#: templates/element/ContractProposalslying_changes.php:46
msgid "What else will be written"
msgstr "Co dalšího se zapíše"

#: templates/element/ContractProposalslying_changes.php:48
msgid ""
"Not all of it was asked for. Applying the changes records the signature on "
"the version, counts an amendment and closes the version being replaced, "
"whether or not the proposal says so."
msgstr ""
"Ne všechno bylo vyžádané. Aplikování změn zapíše podpis na verzi, započítá "
"dodatek a ukončí nahrazovanou verzi, ať už to návrh říká nebo ne."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/billings.php:10
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Nic."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:41
msgid "Add Contract Proposal"
msgstr "Nový návrh ke smlouvě"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:42
msgid "Edit Contract Proposal"
msgstr "Upravit návrh ke smlouvě"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:55
msgid "A proposal of their own"
msgstr "Vlastní návrh zákazníkovi"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:56
msgid "Part of the Customer Proposal"
msgstr "Součást návrhu zákazníkovi"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:58
msgid ""
"Contract proposals that are part of one customer proposal are sent and "
"signed together."
msgstr ""
"Návrhy smluv, které jsou součástí jednoho návrhu zákazníka, se odesílají i "
"podepisují společně."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:69
msgid "Nothing asked of the customer themselves"
msgstr "Po zákazníkovi samotném se nic nežádá"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:70
msgid "Purpose of the New Customer Proposal"
msgstr "Účel nového návrhu zákazníkovi"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:95
msgid "A contract proposal is created for one contract and stays with it."
msgstr "Návrh smlouvy se vytváří k jedné smlouvě a u ní zůstává."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:108
msgid ""
"Left empty, the version is created when the changes of this contract "
"proposal are applied."
msgstr ""
"Když zůstane prázdné, verze vznikne aplikováním změn tohoto návrhu smlouvy."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:114
msgid ""
"The service of this contract keeps no contract versions, so none of our "
"documents are generated for this proposal."
msgstr ""
"Typ služby této smlouvy nemá verze smluv, proto se k tomuto návrhu "
"negenerují žádné naše dokumenty."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:137
msgid "The day this contract proposal takes effect."
msgstr "Den, od kterého návrh smlouvy platí."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:138
msgid ""
"The day this contract proposal takes effect, and the day the version starts "
"on."
msgstr "Den, od kterého návrh smlouvy platí, a den, kterým začíná verze."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:140
msgid ""
"The day this contract proposal takes effect. Empty takes the day the version "
"does, {0}."
msgstr ""
"Den, od kterého návrh smlouvy platí. Prázdné převezme den verze smlouvy, {0}."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:148
msgid ""
"This contract proposal takes effect with the contract version it is for."
msgstr ""
"Tento návrh smlouvy nabývá účinnosti spolu s verzí smlouvy, ke které patří."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:175
msgid "When it ends"
msgstr "Kdy končí"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:181
msgid "Last day of the service"
msgstr "Poslední den služby"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:183
msgid ""
"The version stops being valid on this day, and so does what is billed for."
msgstr "K tomuto dni končí platnost verze i to, co se fakturuje."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:184
msgid "The contract ends on this day, and so does what is billed for."
msgstr "Tímto dnem smlouva končí a s ní i to, co se fakturuje."

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:191
msgid "End this version only, and leave the contract running"
msgstr "Ukončit jen tuto verzi a nechat smlouvu běžet"

#: templates/element/ContractProposals/form.php:192
msgid "For an agreement to end one version with another to follow it."
msgstr "Pro dohodu o ukončení jedné verze, na kterou naváže další."

